      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "En ese primer mundo vivían gigantes. Eran tan fuertes que arrancaban los árboles con las manos.",
          "en": "Giants lived in that first world. They were so strong that they could pull up trees with their bare hands."
        },
        {
          "es": "Un libro antiguo dice que no comían otra cosa que bellotas.",
          "en": "One old book says they ate nothing but acorns."
        },
        {
          "es": "Ese sol duró seiscientos setenta y seis años: trece veces cincuenta y dos.",
          "en": "That sun lasted six hundred and seventy-six years: thirteen times fifty-two."
        },
        {
          "es": "Para los mexicas, cincuenta y dos años eran como un siglo para nosotros.",
          "en": "For the Mexica, fifty-two years was like a century is for us."
        }
